// spec: 12 Runtime panics; 11 Result, Error, Panic, and Record
// panics: library-kind
// Result.fail builds an Error, whose message is a string (section 8, Result).
println(Result.fail("no such file"))
println(Result.fail(404))

// expect
// out: Err{ error: Error{ message: "no such file" } }
// exit: 1
// err: Result.fail needs a string, got int
